"Bitwarden is selected for secret storage, but the “bw” command was not "
"found. Passwords and passphrases will not be stored or autofilled until the "
"CLI is installed.\n"
"\n"
"Open Settings ▸ Security & Credentials to change the backend, or set up "
"Bitwarden now."
